# Workspace — game development files
# NOTE: Some .claude files are committed as they serve as AI agent context
workspace/.claude/agents/      # Agent system prompt .md files (committed)
workspace/.claude/docs/         # Coordination rules, gates, context docs (committed)
workspace/.claude/skills/       # Skill definitions (committed)
workspace/.claude/hooks/       # Hook scripts (committed)
workspace/design/gdd/          # Game Design Documents (gitignored)
workspace/docs/architecture/   # Architecture Decision Records (gitignored)
workspace/production/           # Session state & logs (gitignored)
workspace/src/                 # Game source code (gitignored)
# Keep workspace context files
!workspace/CLAUDE.md
!workspace/.claude/agents/
!workspace/.claude/docs/

